      "pages": [
        {
          "pageNo": 1,
          "text": "Gradient \u0001 Descent \u0001 & \u0001 Learning \u0001 Rate\n경사 \u0001 하강법과 \u0001 학습률 \u0001 · \u0001 Week \u0001 4\n1"
        },
        {
          "pageNo": 2,
          "text": "Gradient \u0001 Descent\nUpdate \u0001 weights \u0001 in \u0001 the \u0001 direction \u0001 that \u0001 lowers \u0001 the \u0001 loss \u0001 function\nLearning \u0001 rate \u0001 (학습률): \u0001 step \u0001 size \u0001 of \u0001 each \u0001 update\nToo \u0001 large \u0001 → \u0001 overshoots \u0001 the \u0001 minimum, \u0001 loss \u0001 may \u0001 diverge\nToo \u0001 small \u0001 → \u0001 slow \u0001 training, \u0001 may \u0001 not \u0001 converge \u0001 within \u0001 the \u0001 epochs\n2"
        },
        {
          "pageNo": 3,
          "text": "Stochastic \u0001 Gradient \u0001 Descent \u0001 (SGD)\nCompute \u0001 the \u0001 gradient \u0001 on \u0001 a \u0001 mini-batch \u0001 instead \u0001 of \u0001 the \u0001 full \u0001 dataset\nFaster \u0001 updates \u0001 per \u0001 step\nGradient \u0001 noise \u0001 can \u0001 help \u0001 escape \u0001 shallow \u0001 local \u0001 minima\n3"
        },
        {
          "pageNo": 4,
          "text": "Learning \u0001 Rate \u0001 Scheduling\nStep \u0001 decay : \u0001 halve \u0001 the \u0001 learning \u0001 rate \u0001 every \u0001 few \u0001 epochs\nCosine \u0001 annealing : \u0001 decrease \u0001 along \u0001 a \u0001 cosine \u0001 curve\nWarmup : \u0001 start \u0001 small \u0001 and \u0001 increase \u0001 the \u0001 learning \u0001 rate \u0001 during \u0001 the \u0001 first \u0001 5 \u0001 epochs\nNext: \u0001 Momentum, \u0001 Adam \u0001 optimizer\n4"
        }
      ]
    }
